DESCRIPTION:Cosmos Music Player 1.2.5 | Cosmos-Music-Player\n\n- Search is 
 now available across songs\, favorites\, artists\, albums\, and playlists.
 \n- Lyrics have been redesigned with smoother synchronization\, tap-to-see
 k\, instrumental breaks\, offline caching\, and alternate versions.\n- Add
 ed broader support for Opus\, Ogg\, FLAC\, AAC/M4A\, DSF\, and DFF files.\
 n- Improved playback stability\, gapless transitions\, seeking\, Bluetooth
 \, CarPlay\, and audio interruption handling.\n- Added appearance options:
  System\, Light\, and Dark.\n- Added controls for automatic library scan f
 requency and artist organization.\n- Added a Create Playlist button when n
 o playlists exist.\n- Improved artwork loading for iCloud and externally i
 mported music.\n- Improved Siri\, widgets\, CarPlay\, and Share extension 
 reliability.\n- Fixed library issues involving moved\, renamed\, restored\
 , or temporarily unavailable files.\n- Added and improved translations acr
 oss all supported languages.\n- Includes numerous performance improvements
  and bug fixes.
